  "license": "MIT",
  "description": "xmuse 2 dsh bundle: sidebar drawer (XMUSE2-VIEW-API v0) + /xmuse join|room new|bind|unbind|status, 9 native xmuse_* tools, long-poll relay of hub messages into the bound session",
